        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Adds <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;a href&gt;</code> to MathML support to Firefox 152</li>\n<li>Removes global <code class=\"notranslate\">href</code> support from Firefox 152</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/mathml-core/#the-a-element\" rel=\"nofollow\">MathML Core adding the <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;a&gt;</code> element and deprecating global <code class=\"notranslate\">href</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2026848\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firefox 151 deprecating the global <code class=\"notranslate\">href</code> attribute</a> (behind the flag)</li>\n<li>Firefox 152 seems to be shipping it enabled by default (AFAIK)</li>\n</ul>",
